{
  "name": "ark-crypto-primitives",
  "description": "ark-crypto-primitives is a core component of the arkworks ecosystem, providing high-performance implementations of cryptographic primitives specifically optimized for zero-knowledge proof systems. It offers a comprehensive suite of traits and gadgets for collision-resistant hashing, hiding commitments, digital signatures, and asymmetric encryption, along with their corresponding Rank-1 Constraint System (R1CS) representations. The library enables the construction of complex SNARK circuits by offering standardized, modular components like Pedersen hashes and Merkle tree accumulators.",
